    "Journal": "ADDED v1.1 for form F-INT-02 and report RP-15. Demo point 15 asks for a balanced journal and its reconciliation to the bank file, and v1.0 had only the mapping table — no journal existed to show. Three things to do on screen: post once and show the ERP reference come back; re-run the same period and show no second posting created, which is what idempotency means here; and note that the overtime run carries its own journal with its own date, so overtime never reaches the ledger inside the salary journal. The gratuity and leave-encashment credit lines use the two accounts added to sheet 35 in v1.1 — without them this journal was short by 700,000 on the credit side.",
